---
layout: default
title: Blog
description: Thoughts on design, development, and building products
---

<h1>Blog</h1>

<section class="post-list" aria-label="Blog posts">
  <ul class="article-list">
    {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      <time datetime="{{ post.date.toISOString() }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
